'''Nora''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be collected as a stamp reward during the [[Nyanko Daisensou ~Nippon Shinryaku Hiroku~]] event. It was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 356
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nora
|name2 = Awakened Nora
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Awakened Nora''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
To put it plainly, Nora is not a very good unit. Outside of [[Empire of Cats]] and early [[Legend Stages]], you are not likely going to find a use for it as its stats are far too low for it to be an effective counter to Dark enemies. Nora is also burdened with Single Attack on top of its mediocre stats, making it even less suited to fighting Dark enemies, which are usually spammed.

