==Trivia==
*Nora's name may be derived from 野良猫 ''noraneko'' (stray cat).
*Nora is the protagonist of the manga [[Nyanko Daisensou ~Nippon Shinryaku Hiroku~]] (にゃんこ大戦争～日本侵略秘録～, "The Great Cat War ~Secrets of the Japan Invasion~") published on Ganma by Ijūin Kazuo (伊集院一雄).
*Nora and [[Manga Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Cat]], [[Manga Boogie Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Boogie Cat]], [[Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat]] are currently the only units based off manga relating to [[The Battle Cats]].
**Nora is the only one that is obtainable in the mobile version, as the others are exclusive to [[The Battle Cats Unite!]].
*One of the [[The Burgle Cats/Roster|Cats]] from [[The Burgle Cats]] is also named Nora, albeit only in English. In Japanese, the Nora from The Burgle Cats is named Narubi (ナル美).

